cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
title: >-
  Ludwieg Tube Designer and Analyser: preliminary design and performance analysis
  of a Ludwieg tube wind tunnel with a free-jet test section
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-10"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23270222
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.23270222
    description: Zenodo DOI for v1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Reddy
    given-names: MRK
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-8420-6672"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TheWa1kingDead/Ludwieg_Designer_and_Analyser"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  MATLAB tool for the preliminary design of a Ludwieg tube wind tunnel with a
  free-jet test section. For a given nozzle exit Mach number and exit
  diameter it computes the driver tube length and mass, freestream conditions,
  minimum vacuum dump-tank volume and its pressure rise during the run,
  storage and pumping times, the uniform test-core rhombus, the largest model
  that fits in it and its blockage, Reynolds-number matching, and the
  operating envelope of unit Reynolds number against stagnation pressure with
  the Reynolds-equivalent flight altitude.
keywords:
  - Ludwieg tube
  - hypersonic wind tunnel
  - free jet
  - test section
  - Reynolds number
  - wind tunnel design
  - MATLAB
